{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她来给出答复",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.second",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那个……不好意思，我叫桑山千雪……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊！我一直在等您，请进！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那个……虽然像是催促，关于上次的答复……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是。被挖角的事……我接受。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真、真的吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是。对我来说是很意外的事，但\"让很多人笑起来\"这句话，我一直忘不掉。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "如果可以在继续现在工作的前提下……让我从上课开始试试。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然！……我会全力支持您！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "哎呀……！谢谢您。请多指教呢，制作人先生。"
      }
    }
  },
